    "active": true,
    "description": "<p>In the past, you usually contacted your patron through intermediaries. Now you can communicate directly; you always have the Contact Other Plane spell prepared. With this feature, you can cast the spell without expending a spell slot to contact your patron, and you automatically succeed on the spell's saving throw.</p><p>Once you cast the spell with this feature, you can't do so in this way again until you finish a Long Rest.</p><section class=\"secret\" id=\"secret-ZobRIiK6iB3SlCis\"><p><strong>Foundry Note</strong></p><p>The spell is granted to you automatically at this level with a free use.</p></section>",
